{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/Logo.png?t=1745177529\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scary creatures started haunting your nightmares. Your doctor tells you to look for Memory Fragments hidden within your mind to figure out : what's causing these visions exactly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/Sleep_And_Wake_Up_By_Monster.gif?t=1745177529\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To find the Memory Fragments, you will have to search through dark forests, damp caves, ancient temples, haunted houses, and creepy catacombs...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/GIF_Worlds_Steampage.gif?t=1745177529\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Filled with traps, these grounds are dangerous. It has been said that many who roamed too deep inside of them never returned with their full sanity...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you brave enough to face your fears?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645430?t=1745177529","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645430?t=1745177529","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/65e2479bc4bb9fcd2119a1399bd6f743de3935bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745177529","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/65e2479bc4bb9fcd2119a1399bd6f743de3935bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745177529","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3664080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragrap